FORM K-1.
IN THE MATTER OF: expungement.

OFF THE RECORD: STRIKE removes a record from the fold by entering a
OFF THE RECORD: tombstone (a genuine Kafka tombstone) in the records
OFF THE RECORD: topic; compaction may eventually forget the key.
OFF THE RECORD: The striking itself, of course, is retained forever.
OFF THE RECORD: This case ends in a verdict, deliberately: asking
OFF THE RECORD: after an expunged witness is itself the offense.

ARTICLE 1.
    LET IT BE RECORDED THAT witness IS "Block, the tradesman".
    PROCLAIM "The witness " PLUS witness PLUS " has testified.".
    STRIKE witness FROM THE RECORD.
    PROCLAIM "The testimony has been struck from the record.".
    PROCLAIM "The record of the striking is retained.".
    PROCLAIM witness.
